description=All-in-One bare-metal undervolt: CPU (-50mV, 200MHz floor), GPU (-50mV, 1068MHz@800mV), DVFSRC Vcore (OPP 0 capped at 650mV / -75mV), and Calibrated EAS/PPM Energy Model (Upower.ko -50mV power curves & EEM disarm). Includes automatic vendor_boot backup and restore.
